    "name": "Social Norms about Tobacco - Adult",
    "code": "PX750303",
    "abbreviation": "PX750303",
    "description": "This protocol uses a combination of questions from the 2011 International Tobacco Control (ITC) 4-Country Survey and the Population Assessment of Tobacco and Health (PATH) Survey Wave 7 instruments. Collectively, the questions are used to assess social norms within the adult population by determinin",
